<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 146 0 R
/T (Key reforms in the housing market, such as regulatory changes in taxation are helping better address challenges in the purchase and rental markets, while other reforms are streamlining construction prerequisites and permitting that speed up the delivery of investments. In addition, the creation of housing agencies and support schemes underpin current and future projects in this area. For instance, in Slovenia local communities, public housing funds and non-profit housing organisations are now offered long-term loans with favourable interest rates for the construction, purchase, or renovation of non-profit rental housing.  )
/E (Key reforms in the housing market, such as regulatory changes in taxation are helping better address challenges in the purchase and rental markets, while other reforms are streamlining construction prerequisites and permitting that speed up the delivery of investments. In addition, the creation of housing agencies and support schemes underpin current and future projects in this area. For instance, in Slovenia local communities, public housing funds and non-profit housing organisations are now offered long-term loans with favourable interest rates for the construction, purchase, or renovation of non-profit rental housing.  )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
