/T (At the same time, support to social inclusion through initiatives such as local housing agencies and the Housing First approach, is in place to effectively address vulnerable situations and homelessness. These initiatives include sheltered dwellings and temporary accommodation with heating and basic utilities, providing immediate safety and helping people move towards more stable housing. Complementary reforms support long-term and community-based care, ensuring that older persons and people with disabilities can live independently within their communities.  )
