/Title (In Poland, a legislative act increasing the support for investments in construction of energy efficient buildings accessible by low- and average-income households entered into force at the end of 2022. Compared to standard housing, support is increased from 80% to 95% for buildings for low-income households and from 35% to 60% for households with average incomes, applied to any source of public support.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1059 0 R
>>
